@startuml
skin rose
participant Client
participant "App" as APP
database "Postgres" as DB
autonumber

== Создание лобби ==

Client->>APP: POST /api/v1/lobbies (Create Lobby)
note right of Client
    Request Body: CreateLobbyReq
    {
      "host_id": int
    }
end note

APP->>DB: BEGIN transaction
note right of DB
    Транзакция:
    1. Создание записи в таблице `lobbies`
    2. Привязка хоста (host_id) к лобби
end note

alt Lobby created successfully
    DB-->>APP: Return lobby ID
    APP->>DB: COMMIT transaction
    APP-->>Client: Return 201 Created with lobby ID
    note right of Client
        Response Body:
        {
          "lobby_id": int,
          "host_id": int
        }
    end note
else Database error
    DB-->>APP: Return error
    APP->>DB: ROLLBACK transaction
    APP-->>Client: Return 500 Internal Server Error
    note right of Client
        Status: 500 Internal Server Error
    end note
end

== Присоединение к лобби ==

Client->>APP: POST /api/v1/lobbies/join (Join Lobby)
note right of Client
    Request Body: JoinLobbyReq
    {
      "lobby_id": int,
      "user_id": int
    }
end note

APP->>DB: Check if lobby exists and is open
alt Lobby exists and is open
    DB-->>APP: Lobby found
    APP->>DB: Add player to `lobby_players`
    alt Player added successfully
        DB-->>APP: Return success
        APP-->>Client: Return 200 OK
        note right of Client
            Response Body:
            {
              "lobby_id": int,
              "user_id": int
            }
        end note
    else Database error
        DB-->>APP: Return error
        APP-->>Client: Return 500 Internal Server Error
        note right of Client
            Status: 500 Internal Server Error
        end note
    end
else Lobby not found or closed
    DB-->>APP: Return error
    APP-->>Client: Return 404 Not Found
    note right of Client
        Status: 404 Not Found
    end note
end
@enduml